    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Snap Flex</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snap Flex is a fast-paced, reflex-driven card game based on the classic <strong>Snap</strong> rules. Players take turns placing cards on the table. When two cards match in rank, the first to snap wins the pile. The goal is simple: collect all the cards to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flex Mode</strong> introduces new ways to play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match both <strong>ranks and suits</strong> for a more dynamic, fast-paced experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with <strong>point-based scoring</strong>, where each successful snap earns points instead of an all-or-nothing win.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Offline Play:</strong> Compete against <strong>CPU</strong> opponents or play locally with <strong>friends</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Multiplayer:</strong> Join or host a <strong>lobby</strong> with up to <strong>four players</strong> and test your reaction speed against others.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple mechanics and quick rounds, <strong>Snap Flex</strong> is easy to learn and fun for players of all ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> Online play includes a text chat feature.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Snap Flex</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snap Flex is a fast-paced, reflex-driven card game based on the classic <strong>Snap</strong> rules. Players take turns placing cards on the table. When two cards match in rank, the first to snap wins the pile. The goal is simple: collect all the cards to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flex Mode</strong> introduces new ways to play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match both <strong>ranks and suits</strong> for a more dynamic, fast-paced experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with <strong>point-based scoring</strong>, where each successful snap earns points instead of an all-or-nothing win.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Offline Play:</strong> Compete against <strong>CPU</strong> opponents or play locally with <strong>friends</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Multiplayer:</strong> Join or host a <strong>lobby</strong> with up to <strong>four players</strong> and test your reaction speed against others.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple mechanics and quick rounds, <strong>Snap Flex</strong> is easy to learn and fun for players of all ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> Online play includes a text chat feature.</p>",
